{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6a2cd861f7881cf52620d720647d86d438d26afbb99b1f3700400a8d1f6959b0", "ja": "（とあるオフの日。エレナに誘われて、街を散歩した。\nいろんな話ができて、いい気分転換になったな……）", "zh": "（某个休息日。受艾莲娜邀请，一起在街上散了散步。聊了很多，感觉心情也转换过来了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b9a466c8ca5341e884d2f5ca5cea5ccb5f702ee28848a74dddeab245df3170a7", "ja": "もうこんな時間か……。\nエレナ、遅くなるといけないし帰ろうか？", "zh": "都这个时间了啊……\n艾莲娜，太晚了可不好，回去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "fa282db6158fe55810ea92422fcff1be4aede57b2667037ae763c9c75bd68a17", "ja": "……。\nね、ねえ{$P$}……。", "zh": "……。\n那、那个，{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1003_p", "source_sha256": "198c38d1b2145e98b1f45ff5ac3a30f23f4bd693667f332e2577a0d5b8489ea6", "ja": "ん？　どうした、エレナ？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了吗，艾莲娜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "a8addd5c1853bf708643c060516579c3b0d00d61f2c1663472a07deefd2de517", "ja": "えっとね……\nまだ、お別れしたくないなって……。", "zh": "那个……\n我还不想道别……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7da0db05353bd47ba313f2b3ad54dfbacbcac1263d81a5a9f723bdbcd3cb9e67", "ja": "エレナ？", "zh": "艾琳娜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "7d20385d8690a3b74fa9af98f309dcda27d12b7231bd3ba0bc5acb2174dd5677", "ja": "{$P$}と、\nバイバイしなきゃって思ったら、寂しくなっちゃった。", "zh": "一想到不得不和{$P$}\n说再见，我就觉得好舍不得。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "03619db525c91e1e1bb6427b6f667d3b1002cc4f3dd764f820364b5d7a3ea381", "ja": "ヘンだよネ……また明日も劇場で会えるのに。\nさっきから胸がキューって苦しいノ……。", "zh": "很奇怪吧……明明明天也能在剧场见到你。\n可从刚才开始，胸口就一阵阵地难受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2b9e9a3f6ea7a324f7128a71c33c0c34aeb2f0f2d9a27edeb5efe6bf99815ee3", "ja": "そうか……。\n寂しいって思うくらい、今日は楽しんでくれたんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……\n看来你今天玩得很开心，开心到都觉得寂寞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "d4d6f487cab003cfa18a7d3f6a47bb28ce7f0378ea44434a69b2a3427912119d", "ja": "もちろんだヨ！　一緒にお仕事したり、\n劇場でお喋りしたりするのは楽しいケド……。", "zh": "当然啦！一起工作、在剧场聊天都很开心，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "ae4214a71ecb8da018223431b9e6b3305c5d1eed475a54c5bd94be911787d3aa", "ja": "今日は、ちょっとだけトクベツな日になったカラ。\nだから、まだ終わってほしくないなって……。", "zh": "因为今天成了稍微有点特别的一天。\n所以……我还不想让它结束……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "1e7de3c65e93284242350c2c2166616a9d6e03738cdb369ceded134c06e790db", "ja": "な、なんてネー！　エヘヘ……。\nワガママ言って、ゴメンナサイ……。", "zh": "才、才不是呢——！嘿嘿……\n说了任性的话，对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1012_p", "source_sha256": "75abc5a48a376ea75cdcd9385ab56e753ed6ad99ed002d52971983801dc4fbc7", "ja": "いや。その気持ちはよくわかるよ。\n今日はとっても楽しかったからな。エレナと同じだ。", "zh": "没有的事。我很能理解你的心情哦。\n因为今天过得非常开心嘛。我和艾莲娜的心情是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "2b827ffb90eec9b8cf0a7952e1eebb61b04c2e42a735a08e711791abbc7bf807", "ja": "えっ？　{$P$}も、\nまだお別れしたくないってコト？", "zh": "诶？{$P$}也不想这么快分别吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1014_p", "source_sha256": "49bfba09f33c73211ab498af54bb9cb79631dbc3f5d248446887d96cec67ee5c", "ja": "ああ。せっかく楽しい時間を過ごしたんだ。\n最後まで、楽しい気持ちで帰りたいからな。", "zh": "嗯。难得度过了这么开心的时光。\n我想一直保持开心的心情，到最后再回去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "99b2a1211e277fa19c7c3baa1065712330782e2f9dfe14182238ca990c5d47bb", "ja": "そっか……エヘヘ♪　それなら、ご飯食べに行こうヨ！\nもうすぐディナーの時間でしょ？", "zh": "这样啊……嘿嘿♪　那就一起去吃饭吧！\n马上就到晚餐时间了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "93bb86072747fec638e80597ba1511f5b2f441037fe6e8d4feeb33daea6cbf42", "ja": "この近くにネ、ブラジル料理のお店があるノ！\nすっごくおいしくて、ワタシのオススメなんだヨ！", "zh": "这附近有一家巴西料理店哦！\n特别好吃，是我推荐的店呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1017_p", "source_sha256": "077a4b2ac6996e5b5b3e501f9d39143a9af28c53bf42d47da9c7d33410a309e8", "ja": "お、エレナのオススメなら間違いないな。\nよし。行ってみようか！", "zh": "哦，既然是艾莱娜推荐的，那肯定没错。\n好，我们去看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "b9fc2379c5c20e669c4301498980d26e25733bb4184a7d814d49d7f0403ffdac", "ja": "やったー♪　じゃあ、お店に案内するネ！\nえっと、あっちに……ああっ、信号が変わっちゃう！？", "zh": "太好了♪那我带你去店里吧！\n嗯……往那边……啊，信号灯要变了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f72d14756e580d88d0f0a309a809b1dc2f2fc6503aaba00184680500baee417c", "ja": "まあまあ、エレナ。\nそんなに急がなくても、お店は逃げないぞ。", "zh": "好了好了，艾莉娜。  \n不用那么着急，店又不会跑掉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "c7e4beb462a01e45b910ab2edc1b6323390063b806520c189da6acd0475f9789", "ja": "そうだけど……。早く行かないと混んじゃうカモ！\nもう……。こうなったら……ぎゅーっ♪", "zh": "是没错……可是再不快点去，可能就要变拥挤了！真是的……既然这样……那就紧紧抱住♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7d1d17306b58c0a9c9d181be5cd4c4f27d334cc6c9935135d648e1b4ae9f7bef", "ja": "エ、エレナ！？\n腕にしがみついて、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "艾、艾蕾娜！？  \n你怎么突然抱住我的胳膊了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "6ed93f384d34c8f747eda7b9708726cc4e211563b7e67b052e62e57c36745ad2", "ja": "エヘヘ、なんでもないヨー。\nほらほら、早くお店に行こうヨ！　それー！！", "zh": "嘿嘿，没什么啦——\n快快，我们赶紧去店里吧！走咯——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1023_p", "source_sha256": "eb349c7ca7f59760e742686b4e0f6d51faa342176321bbb8c2206844d1fa031d", "ja": "わっ！？　腕を引っ張らないでくれ……！", "zh": "哇！？别拽我的胳膊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0334_1024_p", "source_sha256": "84c9fe74ea985bb0983c5910bf55db5fe1d87489b41b6b5a37d20a14be8115de", "ja": "（美味しい料理を食べた後、エレナと別れた。\nそこに寂しさはなく、いつものエレナの笑顔があった）", "zh": "（吃完美味的料理后，和艾蕾娜分别了。那里没有一丝寂寞，只有平日里艾蕾娜的笑容。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
